SlowpokeWell_Cave2_Text_PokeManiac_1::
	.string "I’m waiting to see SLOWPOKE’s moment\n"
	.string "of evolution.\p"
	.string "Through observation, I made a new\n"
	.string "discovery.\p"
	.string "A SLOWPOKE with a KING’S ROCK often\n"
	.string "gets bitten by a SHELLDER.\p"
	.string "Here, I’ll share a KING’S ROCK with\n"
	.string "you.$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave2_Text_PokeManiac_2::
	.string "I’m going to be like SLOWPOKE.\p"
	.string "I’ll wait patiently, so I can see\n"
	.string "one evolve.$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave2_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "Do your POKéMON know HM moves?\p"
	.string "Those moves can be used even if\n"
	.string "your POKéMON has fainted.$"
